  modify_requirement,as31,"agent-renamed-from-session","Capability aggregate MUST be named AgentCapabilities (formerly Agent / AgentSession); it MUST compose decomposed collaborator components and MUST retain its existing event-stream-related public API surface so call sites only change the type name.",null,null,null
